msgctxt "64"
msgid ""
"You gonna give us back what ya stole, or are we gonna have to make ya "
"suffer?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "Forget it! You think I'd hand this town over to you thugs!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"Why don't you mainlanders just head back home? As long as\r\n"
"the Ryudo Family's here, you'll never get far in this town!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"Strong words from somebody who can barely walk. Guess there\r\n"
"ain't no point in draggin' this out further... Boys, make an\r\n"
"example outta this fool!"
msgstr ""

